  "keyFeatures": [
    "Zero-dependency Java library (JVM 21+)",
    "Markup parser with readable tag syntax ([red, bold]Text[/])",
    "Ink: immutable, chainable ANSI string builder similar to Chalk",
    "Full 24-bit RGB and gradient support",
    "no-color.org compliant (respects NO_COLOR env var)",
    "GraalVM native image compatible",
    "Rich terminal components: tables, boxes, frames, trees, item lists, dividers, progress bars",
    "Extensible theme system with built-in Catppuccin, Dracula, Gruvbox, Nord, Tokyo Night palettes",
    "SPI for creating and distributing custom themes",
    "Progress bar easing and animated transitions",
    "StyleContext for scoped, immutable custom styles"
  ],
